Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:25:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] xlate: NX2NAVI_TLD_CLAMP=1 (default 0) clamps every texel
 fetch to its image's size, so an out-of-bounds fetch reads the edge texel
 instead of robustness's zero (the ground fog's ray-march read pale bands at
 the screen edges, #174); its own cache keys; tests/tld_clamp_check.py

